    "one_liner": "基于 CPU 的高性能 Vulkan 1.3 图形 API 软件实现，可作为显卡驱动的即插即用替代",
    "ecosystem": "cpp",
    "bindings": []
  },
  "function_summary": {
    "summary": "SwiftShader 是 Google 开发的高性能 CPU 端 Vulkan 1.3 图形 API 软件渲染器。它完整实现了 Vulkan ICD（Installable Client Driver）接口，使不具备 GPU 硬件或驱动不可用的环境也能运行 Vulkan 应用程序。其核心是一个名为 Reactor 的 JIT 编译器，利用 LLVM 或 Subzero 后端在运行时将 SPIR-V 着色器编译为宿主 CPU 原生机器码，从而实现高效的软件光栅化。项目广泛用于 Chrome/Android 等平台的测试与回退渲染。",
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "Vulkan ICD 实现",
        "description": "完整实现 Vulkan 1.3 Installable Client Driver 接口，导出 vk_icdGetInstanceProcAddr 等 ICD 入口，支持实例/设备创建、命令缓冲区、管线、描述符集、同步对象等全部 Vulkan 核心对象与操作",
        "evidence": [
          "src/Vulkan/libVulkan.cpp:252 (vk_icdGetInstanceProcAddr)",
          "src/Vulkan/VkDevice.cpp",
          "src/Vulkan/VkCommandBuffer.cpp",
          "src/Vulkan/VkPhysicalDevice.cpp"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "SPIR-V 着色器编译与执行",
        "description": "解析 SPIR-V 二进制模块，将着色器指令翻译为可执行代码；涵盖算术、控制流、图像采样、内存操作等全部 SPIR-V 指令集",
        "evidence": [
          "src/Pipeline/SpirvShader.cpp",
          "src/Pipeline/SpirvShaderArithmetic.cpp",
          "src/Pipeline/SpirvShaderControlFlow.cpp",
          "src/Pipeline/SpirvShaderImage.cpp",
          "src/Pipeline/SpirvShaderSampling.cpp"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Reactor JIT 编译器",
        "description": "自研 JIT 编译框架，支持 LLVM 和 Subzero 两个后端；在运行时将着色器及渲染管线阶段编译为优化的宿主 CPU 原生代码，支持 SIMD 向量化",
        "evidence": [
          "src/Reactor/LLVMReactor.cpp",
          "src/Reactor/LLVMJIT.cpp",
          "src/Reactor/SubzeroReactor.cpp",
          "src/Reactor/SIMD.cpp",
          "src/Reactor/Reactor.cpp"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "软件光栅化渲染管线",
        "description": "纯 CPU 实现完整的图形渲染管线，包括顶点处理、图元装配、裁剪、光栅化和像素着色；支持多种纹理压缩格式解码（BC/ETC/ASTC）",
        "evidence": [
          "src/Device/Renderer.cpp",
          "src/Device/VertexProcessor.cpp",
          "src/Device/SetupProcessor.cpp",
          "src/Device/PixelProcessor.cpp",
          "src/Device/QuadRasterizer.cpp",
          "src/Device/ASTC_Decoder.cpp",
          "src/Device/BC_Decoder.cpp",
          "src/Device/ETC_Decoder.cpp"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "窗口系统集成（WSI）",
        "description": "支持多平台窗口系统呈现：Win32 (GDI)、XCB/X11、Wayland、macOS Metal、DirectFB、Fuchsia、Headless 无头模式；动态加载平台显示库",
        "evidence": [
          "src/WSI/Win32SurfaceKHR.cpp",
          "src/WSI/XcbSurfaceKHR.cpp",
          "src/WSI/WaylandSurfaceKHR.cpp",
          "src/WSI/MetalSurface.mm",
          "src/WSI/HeadlessSurfaceKHR.cpp",
          "src/WSI/libXCB.cpp",
          "src/WSI/libWaylandClient.cpp"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "domain": "图形渲染",
    "target_users": "需要在无 GPU 环境下运行 Vulkan 应用的开发者（如 Chrome/Android 团队、CI/CD 自动化测试、嵌入式设备）；也可配合 ANGLE 实现 OpenGL ES 软件渲染（SwANGLE）"
  },
